---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
---
<Legal title="Refund Policy" updated="8 May 2026" summaryColor="green">
  <p slot="summary" class="text-white text-lg font-bold leading-snug">
    30-day money-back guarantee. Reply to your receipt. Money back within 24 hours. No questions asked.
  </p>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Find your Gumroad receipt (sent to the email you used at checkout)</li>
    <li>Reply to it with: "Refund please"</li>
    <li>We process within 24 hours via Gumroad</li>
    <li>Refund typically lands in your account in 3–5 business days (your bank's pace)</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What you don't have to do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Explain why</li>
    <li>Justify yourself</li>
    <li>Try to convince us</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What if I'm past 30 days?</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:wiggjamie9@gmail.com">wiggjamie9@gmail.com</a>. We'll consider it case by case but no guarantees.</p>

  <h2>Cost of compute</h2>
  <p>RHYTHMIX Studio uses your own Replicate API key for AI generation. Any costs you incurred on Replicate are between you and Replicate; we can't refund those.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:wiggjamie9@gmail.com">wiggjamie9@gmail.com</a></p>

  <p slot="footer"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}`} class="text-[#444] no-underline mx-2 hover:text-[#a0a0b0]">Home</a> · <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}studio`} class="text-[#444] no-underline mx-2 hover:text-[#a0a0b0]">Studio</a> · <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}privacy`} class="text-[#444] no-underline mx-2 hover:text-[#a0a0b0]">Privacy</a> · <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}terms`} class="text-[#444] no-underline mx-2 hover:text-[#a0a0b0]">Terms</a></p>
</Legal>
